WEBVTT

1
00:00:03,150 --> 00:00:04,050
dead

2
00:00:04,820 --> 00:00:07,700
my sister-in-law

3
00:00:07,700 --> 00:00:10,020
But why do I still remember

4
00:00:10,220 --> 00:00:42,710
Who put me through life and death? Lock the door and don't say anything. Wait for me. Who is she?

5
00:00:42,830 --> 00:00:43,790
My cousin Liu Hao

6
00:00:44,070 --> 00:00:45,030
during a virus outbreak

7
00:00:45,030 --> 00:00:46,030
He happens to be at my house

8
00:00:52,320 --> 00:00:54,120
Du Xue awakens special abilities

9
00:00:54,320 --> 00:00:59,670
Please stay calm why?

10
00:01:00,440 --> 00:01:06,050
Only I don’t have Liu Hao

11
00:01:06,050 --> 00:01:07,010
what are you doing

12
00:01:07,450 --> 00:01:08,770
The supplies at home are limited

13
00:01:09,010 --> 00:01:10,730
You can't raise a person without super powers

14
00:01:10,930 --> 00:01:12,850
Wanwan will have to rely on supernatural powers to survive from now on

15
00:01:13,090 --> 00:01:14,170
You will only drag him down

16
00:01:14,410 --> 00:01:16,540
This house is mine

17
00:01:16,740 --> 00:01:18,740
It was I who risked my life to save you.

18
00:01:19,260 --> 00:01:20,300
You tell them later

19
00:01:20,700 --> 00:01:22,180
Without me, you would have died a long time ago

20
00:01:22,300 --> 00:01:23,980
You've all been ignored and who told you about the past?

21
00:01:24,180 --> 00:01:25,780
Liu Hao and I have been together for a long time

22
00:01:26,260 --> 00:01:28,020
If you weren't rich and had no parents

23
00:01:28,020 --> 00:01:30,700
You thought I would like you? Listen clearly.

24
00:01:31,180 --> 00:01:32,180
from now on

25
00:01:32,180 --> 00:01:33,620
This villa is ours
